Z||000000||contra||10-02-2000||07:08 PM||||I've had my front spoiler addon (like the kid danger one), and man o man, ever since i put it on it SCRAPES when getting out of parking lots that are angled and onto a flat road. It's like taking a nose dive into the road. Well low and behold, THAT'S EXACTLY WHAT HAPPENED. aargh. Now my front spoiler and new paint is cracked. Now i understand why pontiac has the front end angled upwards, so it has clearance. <P>Not to worry though, i was thinking of taking it off, and i'm definately taking it off now, and i'm going to lower my car without it on. Sure it might scrape SOME, but i wont be damaging my front bumper, just maybe underneath a little.<P>i dunno how these ricers do it with all these lowered cars and expensive body kits<P><BR>If anybody wants to buy this addon i'll sell it for $100<BR>it's not damaged.<P><p>[This message has been edited by contra (edited 10-02-2000).]||||reg||8
