Z||000005||contra||10-02-2000||11:19 PM||||i wish mine was like yours sluppy<BR>i like the way mine looks from the front<BR>but the side view looks funny to me<P>i'm too lazy to fiberglass it to my liking, but i want to lower my car, so i dont think i can have it period. It's a really nice touch tho to the car. i've never been fond of the one with the 2nd opening...i just think it looks really weird that way<P>i've gotten a couple emails on people wanting to buy it, but pretty much, i'm not going to unbolt it from my fascia just yet. i'll probably do it when winter comes. i dunno. my plan is to take it off, resand my whole front fascia, and repaint it again with alot of protective clear coats. and of course i can't really paint my front in the winter time heheh. so i have no idea when this bumper addon will be truely for sale other than i will be selling it eventually cause i dont want it anymore.<BR>||||reg||1
